# Signing material must never be committed to this repository.
# CI receives the keystore via the KEYSTORE_BASE64 GitHub secret instead;
# for local release builds place the file outside version control
# (or point KEYSTORE_FILE at any untracked path).
# NB: `keystore/*` (bukan `keystore/`) supaya exception di bawah bisa
# me-re-include file tertentu — Git tidak bisa re-include di dalam
# direktori yang foldernya sendiri di-exclude.
keystore/*
*.keystore
*.jks
#
# EXCEPTION — keystore/debug.keystore is COMMITTED on purpose (2026-09):
# a debug key is not a secret (it only signs debug APKs), and committing
# it makes every debug build — local, CI, any clone — use the SAME
# stable key so the SHA-256 in web/.well-known/assetlinks.json (App
# Links autoVerify) matches forever. Regenerate with
# `python3 scripts/gen_debug_keystore.py`; rotate = delete + regen +
# update assetlinks.json.
!keystore/debug.keystore

# local.properties holds per-developer SDK paths AND real API keys
# (MAPTILER_API_KEY, SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY) — never
# commit it. CI writes its own local.properties from GitHub secrets
# (.github/workflows/build.yaml + release.yaml).
local.properties
